  "limits": [
    "This approval and proof apply to the exact frozen source and private ROM fingerprint. Final production allocation and independent-core validation remain root-owned.",
    "All original visible bounds, lowest pixels and native cell origins/order are preserved. Whole-source aspect sampling differs by pose as recorded; the cap/coat silhouette is the newly approved model.",
    "The original flash overlays 247 generated body pixels by design. The 363 retained effect pixels are original source samples, not newly drawn geometry or an original body layer.",
    "Two bounded scene routes were executed after reversible diagnostic entry with development party resources. This is not full campaign traversal or ordinary-level balance validation, and not every native AI counter branch was exercised.",
    "Zero display delay was observed in all isolated AA82 cases and three Juggler/decoy battle samples. This does not claim universally identical field/battle latency.",
    "Original party/map/effect overlap hides 41 final pixels in one sampled regular Juggler layer. Complete cells/palettes and unobstructed final pixels are separately proved for all 18 isolated poses.",
    "Three other audited locations were not executed. All-branch scene unions are source resource inventories, not proofs of every simultaneous resident set."
  ]
